// The Last Hope — DECORATE compatibility layer
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// DbyS (Damage by Sector) is enabled globally by DbySSectorHandler in ZSCRIPT:
// sectors with positive damageamount receive SECMF_HURTMONSTERS, so monsters
// and decorations suffer the same sector damage as players. Strife's delayed
// damagehazard sectors are intentionally excluded by the handler.
//
// Enemy AI update:
// - QUICKTORETALIATE: react to incoming damage more promptly.
// - LOOKALLAROUND: acquire threats without remaining front-facing only.
// - CHF_FASTCHASE: use GZDoom's evasive fast-chase behavior while pursuing.
// Vanilla attack, pain, death and resurrection states are inherited unchanged.
// TacticalZombieMan / TacticalShotgunGuy / TacticalChaingunGuy are already
// replaced by ZScript and are enhanced there to avoid duplicate replacements.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

ACTOR TLH_AI_DoomImp : DoomImp replaces DoomImp
{
    +QUICKTORETALIATE
    +LOOKALLAROUND
    States
    {
    See:
        TROO AABBCCDD 3 A_Chase("Melee", "Missile", CHF_FASTCHASE)
        Loop
    }
}

